[
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/trees/fu_agriculture",
    "raw": "Agriculture",
    "value": "农业"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/default/0",
    "raw": "Instructions",
    "value": "介绍"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/default/1",
    "raw": "Select a research by clicking one of the icons on the grid.\nYou can navigate the grid by dragging with the left mouse button.\n\n- The left most button at the upper part of the screen opens a list of research trees to pick from.\n\n- The second button opens a list of non-hidden research options. Click a research on the displayed to center the view on it. Click again to hide the list.\n\n- The third button will center the view on the middle of the tree, or the currently selected research.\n\n- The last button toggles ^orange;low quality mode^reset;. This makes the GUI jump to a position instead of panning to it, or the center button. In addition, dragging/navigating on the the main screen will update only after you release the mouse button. It is best to use the search list with this mode enabled.",
    "value": "通过点击网格上的图标来选择一项研究。\n您可以通过按住鼠标左键拖动来导航网格。\n\n- 屏幕顶部最左侧的按钮用于打开可供选择的研究树列表。\n\n- 第二个按钮用于打开非隐藏的研究选项列表。点击列表中显示的研究项，可将视图居中定位到该研究的图标上。再次点击该按钮可隐藏列表。\n\n- 第三个按钮用于将视图居中定位到科技树的中心，或者当前选中的研究项目上。\n\n- 最后一个按钮用于切换 ^orange;低质量模式^reset;。此模式下，界面将直接跳转到目标位置，而非通过平移动画（搜索列表或居中按钮触发的动画）移动。此外，在主屏幕上的拖动导航操作，仅在释放鼠标按钮后才会更新视图。建议在此模式下使用搜索列表功能。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/0",
    "raw": "Basic Training",
    "value": "基础训练"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/survival_1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYour training, thanks to four years in the Protectorate Academy, provides you with basic survival skills to keep you alive for extended periods in the event of a crash.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n得益于在守护团学院的四年学习，您所受的训练为你提供了基本的生存技能，确保在发生坠机等意外时能够长时间维持生命。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/foragingn/0",
    "raw": "Agriculture",
    "value": "农业"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/foragingn/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned how to build a ^orange;Foraging Table^reset; which is the place to invest into agricultural pursuits and hunting. You also learn to make some simple farming tools and a means to capture useful wild bugs.\n\nInvesting into this tree will allow you to learn to create your own plant seeds to grow foodstuffs or useful effect-granting plants, how to raise farm beasts, how to hunt and fish, advanced farming techniques and how to raise bees.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您已学会建造^orange;采集工作台^reset;，这是投身农业与狩猎活动的核心设施。您还可在此学习制作简易农具及捕捉有用野生昆虫的方法。\n\n投资此研究分支将使您掌握以下能力：培育植物种子以种植食用作物或特殊功效植物、饲养农场牲畜、狩猎与捕鱼、先进农业技术以及养蜂方法。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/crops1/0",
    "raw": "Basic Crops",
    "value": "基础作物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/crops1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nThough the universe is filled with many strange plants, the Protectorate academy taught you about quite a few. You've learned to start culvtivating these plants for yourself at a ^orange;Greenhouse^reset; which can be made at your ^orange;Machining Table^reset;. You can also (crudely) extract genetic material from plants for use in the creation of more complex plants at a ^cyan;Sprouting Table^reset;, also made at your Machining Table.\n\n^yellow;Tip:^reset; Grow lots of corn! Corn is an incredibly versatile crop, being a source of oil, cattle feed, and the basis of many more complex plants.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n虽然宇宙中充满奇异的植物，但守护团学院已为您打下扎实基础。您已学会在^orange;温室^reset;（可在^orange;加工台^reset;制作）中自行培育这些植物。此外，您还可在^orange;植物分析台^reset;（同样在^orange;加工台^reset;制作）从植物中（初步）提取遗传物质，用于在更复杂的环境中培育进阶植物。\n\n^yellow;小贴士：^reset;^red;多种玉米！^reset;玉米是一种用途极广的作物，可作为油料、牛饲料，也是许多复杂植物的培育基础。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/crops2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Crops",
    "value": "高等作物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/crops2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've mastered all the plants the Protectorate Academy taught you about, allowing you to artificially create many more plants, including the all-important ^yellow;Cotton^reset;.\n\nYou're ready to start branching into making various medicinal plants that don't provide satiation, but don't spoil and provide useful buffs like environmental resistance, healing, increased stats, or even act as weapons!\n\nYou'll need ^orange;genes^reset; from this point on - found by processing seeds, saplings and some produce in the ^cyan;Sprouting Table^reset; or its upgrades. Some plants produce more seeds than others: flowers unsuited for dye-making are a good early source of seeds.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已掌握守护团学院传授的全部植物知识，现在可以人工培育更多作物，包括制作护甲、家具、时装和服装时至关重要的^yellow;棉花^reset;。\n\n接下来您可以着手培育各类药用植物，它们虽不提供饱腹感，但不会腐败，并能赋予环境抗性、治疗、属性增强等实用增益，甚至可作为武器使用！\n\n培育需要^orange;基因^reset;资源，可通过在^cyan;植物分析台^reset;或其升级设施中处理种子、树苗及部分农产品获得。不同植物的产种量有所差异：不适合制染料的花朵是早期的理想种子来源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explorationplants1/0",
    "raw": "Basic Exploration Plants",
    "value": "基础探索植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explorationplants1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nThe universe is a dangerous place, filled with many environments your physiology isn't equipped to handle. Your research has given you access to a number of plants that make the universe a little more forgiving, including plants that assist in traversing difficult terrain, produce natural antitoxins, and shore up your physiology from dangerous climates.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n宇宙充满危险，许多环境超出了您生理的承受极限。您的研究现已解锁多种能让宇宙变得更友善的植物，包括助您穿越复杂地形、产生天然抗毒素，以及在恶劣气候下增强生理适应能力的品种。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explorationplants2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Exploration Plants",
    "value": "高等探索植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explorationplants2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nFurther research has given you plants that can protect you entirely from poisons and acid, as well as shield you from the dangerous radiation of many alien materials.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n进一步的研究让您获得了能完全抵御毒素和酸蚀的植物，并能屏蔽许多外星物质带来的危险辐射。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explorationplants3/0",
    "raw": "Superior Exploration Plants",
    "value": "高级探索植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explorationplants3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou're becoming especially adept at exploring alien worlds through the use of bioengineering, and have created several new plants protecting from more esoteric threats, including the crushing pressure of gas giants, eldritch ghosts, and even the poor mental health hours of slaving away over a gene lab results in.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n通过生物工程技术，您已能熟练探索外星世界，并培育出多种新型植物，可应对更特殊的威胁，包括气态巨行星的极端压力、诡异幽灵，以及因长期在基因实验室劳作导致的精神健康问题。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explorationplants4/0",
    "raw": "Master Exploration Plants",
    "value": "大师探索植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/explorationplants4/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nYour latest plants are a thing of beauty, protecting you from even the most dangerous worlds. Equipped only with the contents of your herb pouch, you're now equipped to explore nearly any world imaginable, including those with lead-melting heat, atmospheres so cold it falls to the ground as snow and environments so radioactive that even the ground glistens with energy.",
    "value": "^orange;6级^reset;\n\n您最新培育的植物堪称美丽而强大，即便在最危险的世界中也能提供周全保护。仅凭草药袋中的装备，您现已能探索几乎所有可想象的环境，包括铅块都会熔化的极热地带、大气凝结成雪的酷寒之地，以及辐射强烈到地面都闪烁发光的区域。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/utilityplants1/0",
    "raw": "Basic Utility Plants",
    "value": "基础工具植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/utilityplants1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nThe universe is a gruelling place, requiring great effort to extract the meanest of resources from it. Your research uses the miracle of life to lift this burden, by creating plants which provide silk, genetic resources, healing, and mining aids, saving your valuable resources and effort for where they're needed elsewhere.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n宇宙环境严酷，即使获取最基础的资源也需付出巨大努力。您的研究利用生命奇迹减轻这一负担，通过培育能提供丝绸、基因资源、愈合物质和采矿辅助的植物，将宝贵的资源和精力节省下来，以备其他关键之需。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/utilityplants2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Utility Plants",
    "value": "高等工具植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/utilityplants2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nThrough careful experimentation, you've created plants that produce incredibly useful resources, including organic silicon, radiation-resistant silk and enhanced algae which can be processed into fuel for your ship and mech.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n通过细致实验，您已成功培育出能产出多种珍贵资源的植物，包括有机硅、抗辐射蚕丝，以及可加工为飞船或机甲燃料的强化藻类。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/utilityplants3/0",
    "raw": "Superior Utility Plants",
    "value": "高级工具植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/utilityplants3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nAn adept at genetic engineering, you've begun to create plants which greatly light your way in the darkness, beyond the level that Gold Shroom was capable of. You're also experimenting with organic performance enhancers, including those which protect your body from lethal falls and gravitic rain.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n作为基因工程专家，您已成功培育出能在黑暗中自发光照明的植物，其性能远超金色蘑菇。同时您开始尝试机性能增强剂，其中包括能保护身体免受致命坠落和重力雨伤害的制剂。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/utilityplants4/0",
    "raw": "Master Utility Plants",
    "value": "大师工具植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/utilityplants4/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nThe plants you've learned to make would be illegal in any Olympics, if Earth still existed. You can now run at breakneck speeds, jump up sheer surfaces and even alter the strength of gravity on your body, all with the use of plants. You've also dipped into stranger, less corporeal realms, and created a type of plant which can be eaten in a life-or-death situation to pull you away to safety.",
    "value": "^orange;6级^reset;\n\n若地球尚存，您所研制的植物在任何奥运会上都将被禁用。如今借助植物之力，您得以疾速奔驰、飞檐走壁，甚至自由调控身体所受的重力。您还涉足更为玄妙的灵躯领域，培育出可在生死关头食用、将您瞬间传送至安全地带的特殊植物。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/soulleaf/0",
    "raw": "Essence Cultivation",
    "value": "精华培养"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/soulleaf/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 7^reset;\n\nUsing the properties of Quantum Fluid, you are able to make a plant that grows Ancient Essence botanically. Essence is very useful for upgrading weapons at ancient crucibles.",
    "value": "^orange;7级^reset;\n\n利用量子流体的特性，您已能够通过植物培育的方式生产古代精华。古代精华对于在远古熔炉中升级武器极为重要。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/combatplants1/0",
    "raw": "Basic Combat Plants",
    "value": "基础助战植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/combatplants1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nThe universe is a hostile place, with countless monsters and enemies out for your blood and few allies to stand alongside. Your research levels the playing field, fortifying your health and increasing your defenses to shield you from harm.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n宇宙充满敌意，无数怪物与敌人虎视眈眈，而盟友寥寥无几。您的研究将打破这一劣势，通过植物强化生命体征、提升防御能力，助您抵御一切威胁。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/combatplants2/0",
    "raw": "Advanced Combat Plants",
    "value": "高等战斗植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/combatplants2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4^reset;\n\nYour studies have borne fruit, granting you the ability to grow stronger varieties of fortifying plants, as well as a curious tentacled plant that reflects damage back at those who would seek to harm you.",
    "value": "^orange;4级^reset;\n\n您的研究已开花结果，现在不仅能培育出更强大的强化植物，还能种植一种奇特的触手植物，它能将伤害反弹给试图攻击您的敌人。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/combatplants3/0",
    "raw": "Superior Combat Plants",
    "value": "高级助战植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/combatplants3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nThrough much experimentation, you're gradually becoming a force to be reckoned with. Your plants can strengthen you to inhuman levels, sap your enemies' life and increase the damage you deal out.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n经过大量试验，您正逐渐成为一股不可忽视的力量。您的植物能将您强化至超常水平，不仅能吸取敌人的生命值，还能大幅提升您造成的伤害。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/combatplants4/0",
    "raw": "Master Combat Plants",
    "value": "大师助战植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/combatplants4/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 6^reset;\n\nAn unstoppable juggernaut, you now hunt those who used to prey upon you, draining their vitality even as you slay them with your organic weapons. The universe is yours to take now, and your genetic weaponry is unparalelled.",
    "value": "^orange;6级^reset;\n\n成为不可阻挡的战神后，您开始追捕曾经的掠食者。即便用有机武器终结敌人，也会先吸尽其生命力。宇宙已是您的囊中之物，您的基因武器堪称举世无双。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/kadavan/0",
    "raw": "Kadavan Crops",
    "value": "卡达文作物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/kadavan/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 2^reset;\n\nYou've learned to cultivate some strange Avikan crops, farmed by a race of starfaring nomads originally from the planet Kadavan.",
    "value": "^orange;2级^reset;\n\n您已掌握培育阿威坎异星作物的技术，这些作物由最初来自卡达文星球的星际游牧民族所培育。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/aquaticplants/0",
    "raw": "Aquatic Plants",
    "value": "水生植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/aquaticplants/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4.5^reset;\n\nYou've learned how to develop some specialized plants that enhance your mobility in water, and created Vorit, a strange jelly-like mushroom which allows you to breathe normally underwater or even in a total vacuum for a while, then harmlessly passes through your system.\n\nAquapods are especially useful for the copious amounts of genetic information they contain, in both the seeds and bulbs.",
    "value": "^orange;4.5级^reset;\n\n您已掌握培育特殊水生植物的技术，这些植物能显著提升水下机动性。劳瑞冻，一种奇特的胶状蘑菇，可使您在水下甚至真空环境中正常呼吸，随后无害排出体外。\n\n水生类植物的种子和球茎富含大量遗传信息，具有特殊研究价值。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/garpberry/0",
    "raw": "Garp Berries",
    "value": "嘉普浆果"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/garpberry/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5.5^reset;\n\nYou've created Garp berries, an incredibly useful plant which can be used both eaten to protect yourself from radioactive burns, and processed in your extraction lab to create the rare and extremely useful Alien Compound.",
    "value": "^orange;5.5级^reset;\n\n您培育出了嘉普浆果，这是一种极其有用的植物，既可以食用以防护放射性灼伤，又能在你的提取实验室中加工，制成稀有且极为实用的外星化合物。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/blisterbush/0",
    "raw": "Blister Bush",
    "value": "泡荚灌木"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/blisterbush/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3.5^reset;\n\nYou've learned to grow the gross-but-useful Blister Pods. They're bioluminescent, and can be used in making weapons and armor, as well as lights for decorating your base.",
    "value": "^orange;3.5级^reset;\n\n您已掌握培育恶心但实用的泡荚技术。这种生物发光体可用于制造武器护甲，亦可作为基地装饰灯具。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/energeticplants/0",
    "raw": "Energetic Plants",
    "value": "能量植物"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/energeticplants/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 4.5^reset;\n\nYou've created a family of plants that fortify your natural energy reserves, including Energiflower, a plant so packed with energy that it can even power your ship's FTL drive.",
    "value": "^orange;4.5级^reset;\n\n您已培育出能增强自然能量储备的植物系列，其中包括能量花，这种植物蕴含的能量极为充沛，甚至能为你的飞船超光速引擎提供动力。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/aenema/0",
    "raw": "Aenema Flowers",
    "value": "艾玛花"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/aenema/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5.5^reset;\n\nThe searing hot petals of the Aenema plant are packed with useful Caliginous Gas just waiting to be extracted. Now that you can cultivate your own Aenema, you will have easy access to that resource.",
    "value": "^orange;5.5级^reset;\n\n艾玛花灼热的花瓣富含珍贵的暗影气体，随时可被提取。现在您已能自主培育艾玛花，可轻松获取这一资源。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/thornitox/0",
    "raw": "Thornitox Weaponry",
    "value": "棘刺军备"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
