  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/throwableplants2/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 5^reset;\n\nYou've created a number of even stronger plants, which are devastating when thrown, and in the case of hellfire plants can even be used to create some powerful weapons, with some further research in the weaponry tree.",
    "value": "^orange;5级^reset;\n\n您已培育出多种威力更强的植物，投掷时具有毁灭性效果。若在军械科技树深入研发，地狱火植物甚至能用于制造强力武器。"
