  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/treecloner/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou've used your knowledge of genetic engineering to splice trees together into strange combined forms with the trunk of one tree and the leaves of another. The possibilities are immense, and experimentation will yield great results.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n运用基因工程技术，您已成功将不同树木的树干与叶片进行嫁接，创造出奇特的组合形态。这项实验蕴含无限可能，持续探索必将获得丰硕成果。"
