  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/farming1/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 1^reset;\n\nYou've learned some more complex methods of farming and can now build several helpful farming objects. The ^cyan;Growing Tray^reset; is the most important of these, as it will automatically grow seeds placed inside with the help of fertilizers that increase yields far beyond what is possible through manual labor. Craft it at your ^orange;Foraging Table^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;1级^reset;\n\n您已掌握更复杂的耕作方法，现在可以制作多种实用农耕设备。其中^cyan;生长托盘^reset;最为关键，它能通过肥料自动培育放入的种子，实现远超人工耕作的产量提升。请在^orange;采集工作台^reset;处进行制作。"
  },
