  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/strings/research/farming3/1",
    "raw": "^orange;Tier 3^reset;\n\nYou can make an hydroponics-powered Growing Tray that operates even faster when powered, and doesn't use extra water like the Heatlamp Tray does. You can find it at your ^orange;Electronics Center^reset;.",
    "value": "^orange;3级^reset;\n\n您可以制作电力驱动的水培生长托盘，供电时运行速度更快，且不会像热灯托盘那样消耗额外水分。该设备可在^orange;电子设备制造机^reset;中制作。"
